WEBVTT

5.1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.550
Your request now sits under Completed.

5.2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.200
Need to change something? You can, until we close the request.

5.3
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:13.742
Here, the feathergrass count has come in. Set it to Available.

5.4
00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:20.842
The request goes back to Processing, so press Re-Submit availability to send us the update.

5.5
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:27.625
Want a colleague to help, without a login? Press Share, then Make public. The link is copied for you.

5.6
00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:33.992
Anyone with it can view and answer this request. Press Make private to switch the link off.

5.7
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:43.500
Prefer paper? The print button gives you a sheet to fill in at the yard. Snap a photo of it and send it to us in chat.

5.8
00:00:43.967 --> 00:00:48.842
Once we close a request, you'll find it under Order/Request History.
